"""
taal_inventory/scripts/si_loader.py

Bulk Sales Invoice loader — April–June 2026 from Tally export.

RUN VIA:
  bench execute taal_inventory.scripts.si_loader.run --args '{"start": 0, "count": 10}'

Args:
  start  : first row index to process (0-based, default 0)
  count  : how many rows to process this call (default 10 for first run,
           then 50 or 100 once verified)
  dry_run: 1 = simulate only, no writes (default 0)

The script processes invoices in strict date order, auto-creates missing
customers (Individual / India), builds the full tax table matching CS_18
exactly, and submits each invoice — firing the normal on_submit hook
(FEFO deduction + COGS journal entry).

Failures are logged and the script continues to the next invoice.
"""

